Variables:
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
X: streamwise distance from LE of test section [m]
Y: vertical distance from the top surface of the splitter plate [m]
Z: spanwise distance from the centerline of the test section [m]
Pamb: ambient lab pressure [hPa]
RH: lab relative humidity [%]
T: freestream air temperature [C]
Uinf: incoming freestream velocity measured by Pitot-static probe [m/s]
U: streamwise velocity [m/s]
V: vertical velocity [m/s]
uRMS: RMS value of streamwise velocity fluctuations [m/s]
vRMS: RMS value of vertical velocity fluctuations [m/s]
Ruu: time-averaged Reynolds normal stress in streamwise direction (u_i-U)^2 ([m^2/s^2]
Rvv: time-averaged Reynolds normal stress in vertical direction (v_i-V) [m^2/s^2]
Ruv: time-averaged Reynolds shear stress, (u_i-U)(v_i-V) [m^2/s^2]
e_U: uncertainty in U [m/s]
e_V: uncertainty in V [m/s]
e_uRMS: uncertainty in uRMS [m/s]
e_vRMS: uncertainty in uRMS [m/s]
e_Ruu: uncertainty in Ruu [m^2/s^2]
e_Rvv: uncertainty in Rvv [m^2/s^2]
e_Ruv: uncertainty in Ruv [m^2/s^2]
